data: {"delta":"\n\nHere is the table showing AAPL's daily closing price and dollar change from the Historical Prices widget:\n\n| Date | Close | Change ($) |\n|---|---|---|\n| 2026-08-26 | 232.80 | — |\n| 2026-08-27 | 234.65 | +1.85 |\n| 2026-08-28 | 235.10 | +0.45 |\n| 2026-08-31 | 237.40 | +2.30 |\n| 2026-09-01 | 238.15 | +0.75 |\n\n**Key takeaways:**\n- AAPL has posted **five consecutive days of gains**, rising from $232.80 to $238.15.\n- The largest single-day jump was on August 31 (+$2.30), accounting for nearly half of the total 5-day gain.\n- The stock is up **+$5.35 (+2.30%)** over this five-day stretch."}

